; Zona DNS antitraporder.web.id — dilayani oleh NSD di VPS (13.228.178.42).
; Nameserver: ns1/ns2.kousozo.tech (A record-nya diatur di DNS kousozo.tech).
; Naikkan serial (YYYYMMDDnn) setiap mengubah isi zona, lalu: sudo nsd-control reload
$ORIGIN antitraporder.web.id.
$TTL 3600
@   IN SOA ns1.kousozo.tech. hostmaster.kousozo.tech. (
        2026111001 ; serial
        7200       ; refresh
        900        ; retry
        1209600    ; expire
        3600 )     ; minimum
    IN NS  ns1.kousozo.tech.
    IN NS  ns2.kousozo.tech.
@   IN A   13.228.178.42
www IN A   13.228.178.42
api IN A   13.228.178.42
*   IN A   13.228.178.42
